# Mojang (official) names used by awakening/src -> Forge 1.20.1 runtime (SRG) names.
#
# The build remaps every obfuscated member reference through this table and fails on anything
# missing. tools/check_mappings.py proves each line against MCPConfig 1.20.1 (SRG id, declaring
# class, descriptor) and against Fabric intermediary + Yarn 1.20.1 (an independent name for the same
# obfuscated member), so a wrong id cannot be shipped by accident.
#
# C <official class> <yarn class>
# M|F <stub owner> <name> <descriptor> <srg> <declaring official class> <yarn name>
#
# A Yarn name of "-" marks a member Yarn only names on a supertype; those must instead be proven by
# an identical SRG reference in the original, working input JAR.

